### Collector interface

```go
type Collector interface {
    Name() string
    Owner() meta.Object
    Start() error          // start goroutine, return quickly
    Shutdown()
    HasParity() bool       // initial sync complete
    DB() model.DB
    Test() (int, error)    // 0 = ignore status code
    Follow(moRef, path, dst) error
    Reset()
    Version() (string, string, string, string, error)  // oVirt-only
}
```

