## Status Conditions

| Category | Blocks Reconcile | Blocks Ready |
|----------|------------------|--------------|
| `Critical` | Yes | Yes |
| `Error` | No | Yes |
| `Warn` | No | No |
| `Required` | No | Required for Ready |
| `Advisory` | No | No |

### Query methods

| Method | Returns true when... |
|--------|---------------------|
| `HasCondition(types...)` | ALL types exist with Status=True |
| `HasAnyCondition(types...)` | ANY type exists with Status=True |
| `HasConditionCategory(cats...)` | Any condition in category with Status=True |
| `HasBlockerCondition()` | Critical OR Error present |
| `HasReQCondition()` | `ValidatingVDDK` OR `VMMissingChangedBlockTracking` |
| `IsReady()` | Ready condition exists with Status=True |
| `FindCondition(type)` | Returns pointer (nil if absent or un-staged during staging) |

`Explain` tracks `Added`, `Updated`, `Deleted` maps for the current staging cycle.

