## Integration Points

| Package | Called by | Calls |
|---------|-----------|-------|
| `condition` | All controllers, CRD status types | — |
| `inventory/container` | Provider controller | `inventory/model`, `filebacked`, `ref` |
| `inventory/model` | Collectors, REST handlers | `filebacked`, SQLite |
| `inventory/web` | Provider controller (`web.Start`) | `gin`, `inventory/container` |
| `itinerary` | Plan/migration controllers | `error` |
| `ref` | All controllers with cross-resource deps | controller-runtime predicates/handlers |
| `client/openshift` | OCP provider, plan adapters | `util`, controller-runtime client |
| `client/openstack` | OpenStack provider | Gophercloud |
| `client/nutanix` | Nutanix inventory + plan adapter | `inventory/web.Client`, `util` |
| `aap` | Hook controller (AAP integration) | HTTP AAP/AWX API |
| `hyperv/driver` | Hyper-V provider collector | WinRM, PowerShell scripts |
| `error` | Everywhere | `runtime.Callers` for stack capture |
| `logging` | Everywhere | Zap via logr |

**Dependency direction:** feature controllers → `pkg/lib` → external libraries.
`pkg/lib` must never import from `pkg/controller/`.

