## Configuration

| Env var | Package | Effect |
|---------|---------|--------|
| `LOG_LEVEL` | `logging` | Verbosity threshold (default 4 in dev mode) |
| `LOG_DEVELOPMENT` | `logging` | Human-readable output; default verbosity=4 |

Verbosity conventions: V(0) normal, V(2-3) detailed, V(4) DB ops, V(5-6) file I/O.

### Inventory model field tags

| Tag | Meaning |
|-----|---------|
| `sql:"pk"` | Primary key |
| `sql:"key"` | Natural key, indexed |
| `sql:"fk:Table(field)"` | Foreign key with cascade |
| `sql:"unique(group)"` | Unique constraint |
| `sql:"const"` | Immutable after insert |
| `sql:"incremented"` | Auto-increment |
| `sql:"d0"` | Detail level for list queries |
| `eq:"-"` | Skip in `DefaultShepherd` equality |

